{"content":[{"c":["KEDESH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Town in the Judean Negev (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.23","r":"Josh.15.23","rawR":"Josh.15.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.23","value":"Josh.15.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 15:23"},"); its appearance alongside Adadah (Aroer) argues against its identification with Kadesh-barnea."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. City of refuge in upper Galilee, in the territory of Naphtali (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.20.7","r":"Josh.20.7","rawR":"Josh.20.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.20.7","value":"Josh.20.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 20:7"},"), set apart for the Gershonite clan of Levi (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.21.32","r":"Josh.21.32","rawR":"Josh.21.32","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.21.32","value":"Josh.21.32"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 21:32"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.76","r":"1Chr.6.76","rawR":"1Chr.6.76","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.76","value":"1Chr.6.76"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:76"},"), and the home of Barak (",{"href":"?bref=Judg.4.6","r":"Judg.4.6","rawR":"Judg.4.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.4.6","value":"Judg.4.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 4:6"},"). It was conquered by Tiglath-pileser III in 732 ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"}," (",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.15.29","r":"2Kgs.15.29","rawR":"2Kgs.15.29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.15.29","value":"2Kgs.15.29"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 15:29"},"). Jonathan Maccabeus defeated the army of Demetrius there (",{"href":"?bref=1Macc.11.63,73","r":"1Macc.11.63,73","rawR":"1Macc.11.63,73","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Macc.11.63,73","value":"1Macc.11.63,73"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Macc 11:63, 73"},"). It is identified with Tell Qades, four and a half miles (7.2 kilometers) northwest of Lake Huleh."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=CitiesofRefuge_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"CitiesofRefuge_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"CitiesofRefuge_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Cities of Refuge"},"."],"sourceClass":"list-text","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Levitical city in Issachar (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.72","r":"1Chr.6.72","rawR":"1Chr.6.72","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.72","value":"1Chr.6.72"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:72"},"); the parallel passage has Kishion (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.21.28","r":"Josh.21.28","rawR":"Josh.21.28","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.21.28","value":"Josh.21.28"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 21:28"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=LeviticalCities_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"LeviticalCities_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"LeviticalCities_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Levitical Cities"},"."],"sourceClass":"list-text","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Kedesh","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 15:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.23","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.23","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.23"},{"anchorText":"Jos 20:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.20.7","rawQueryValue":"Josh.20.7","sourceRefExact":"Josh.20.7"},{"anchorText":"Jos 21:32","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.21.32","rawQueryValue":"Josh.21.32","sourceRefExact":"Josh.21.32"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 6:76","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.76","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.76","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.76"},{"anchorText":"Jgs 4:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.4.6","rawQueryValue":"Judg.4.6","sourceRefExact":"Judg.4.6"},{"anchorText":"2 Kgs 15:29","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.15.29","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.15.29","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.15.29"},{"anchorText":"1 Macc 11:63, 73","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Macc.11.63,73","rawQueryValue":"1Macc.11.63,73","sourceRefExact":"1Macc.11.63,73"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 6:72","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.72","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.72","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.72"},{"anchorText":"Jos 21:28","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.21.28","rawQueryValue":"Josh.21.28","sourceRefExact":"Josh.21.28"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"0023b35a480d811ad787ce8cddce1cf0d4c3c40f1d71954b625def2322936620","sourceItemName":"Kedesh","sourceItemOrder":24,"sourceMember":"Articles/K.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Kedesh","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Kedesh","title":"Kedesh","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}